[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21700200_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21700200_03_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21700200_03_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21700200_03_0010","text":"……咦\n今天也有摄影师在啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21700200_03_0020","text":"啊，今天是来拍练习场景的\n——不是跟你说过了吗，朝日"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21700200_03_0030","text":"啊哈哈\n刚想起来的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21700200_03_0000","text":"摄影师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21700200_03_0040","text":"打扰了\n可能会有点难集中精神，拜托了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21700200_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21700200_03_0050","text":"……？\n没问题"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21700200_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21700200_03_0060","text":"——呼……哈……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21700200_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21700200_03_0062","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21700200_03_0070","text":"哎呀……不像昨天那样穿演出服\n也没化妆……果然还是好舒服啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21700200_03_0080","text":"——是吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21700200_03_0090","text":"啊哈哈，这语气像是在说“那不是当然的吗”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21700200_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21700200_03_0100","text":"……呼\n哈……"}]
